{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-026-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>曾經何時，裕民坊的路口，一眼看見當舖和餐廳的搶眼招牌。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_7544-2-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>裕民坊入口處，曾掛著一個別具特色的手寫招牌。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0111-012-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>裕民坊的麥當勞，在 1981 年開業，是觀塘第一間麥當勞，在 90 年代，是全球十大最繁忙的麥當勞。至 2017 年，因觀塘重建而結業。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-033-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>觀塘裕民坊，多年來一直車水馬龍，是街坊購物，搭車轉車的重地。如今車路已封，巴士都已改道。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-042-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>小巷裏的粉麵店、還有租書店，多年來為街坊飽肚，和提供精神食糧。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0912-024-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0912-073-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1005-078-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0912-090-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>仁愛圍路口的小販區，小販多只在上午開檔。背後的雞記蔴雀娛樂，是裕民坊的地標，現已隨重建而搬舖。雞記蔴雀娛樂在 1933 年已創立，在 50 年代，雞記老闆曾代表業界，向政府爭取為麻雀館發牌。觀塘的雞記，在 1976 年開張。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-020-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>銀都戲院，䇄立半世紀，在 2009 年結業，現址已建成豪宅。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0909-005-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>寶聲戲院，在 1995 年結業，其後改建成寶聲娛樂城。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0224-003-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1005-075-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0529-007-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0228-010-1024x684.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1005-044-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0228-001-1024x684.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0627-DVS_9202-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-05T04:59:25.489597+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":368,"images":19,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}